X:1
T:Space Cowboy
C:Jamiroquai
M:4/4
O:England, 1994
N:Second verse and chorus. Melody from the vocal channel (channel 3) of a MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com, track 352558320632340), moved down a minor sixth from B-flat minor to D minor so it fits the recorder (C4 to G5). Single source: a second arrangement (track 353076027281921) carries only sustained chord pads, no lead line. The second verse is used because the first one dips to C-sharp 4, which no transposition fits together with the chorus's high E-flat. Chords from the bass, piano and electric piano channels. The source's pickup into the post-chorus (two sixteenths at the end of the last bar) is left out so the tune loops. At the start of bar 8 the source sounds a sixteenth A-flat together with the G; the G is kept. Humanized onsets snapped to the sixteenth grid; releases up to an eighth short of the next note are filled in.
